        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Problem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000002"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What is wrong or missing today, for whom, and how we know (a number, a quote, a ticket)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000003",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Appetite"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000004"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How much it is worth: a few days, two weeks? The solution must fit it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000005",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Proposed solution"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000006"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The core of the idea in a few lines or a rough sketch, enough to judge it, not a design."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000007",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Success"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000008"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How we will know it worked, measured: \"complaints about X fall by half\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-000009",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No-gos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-00000a"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What we will deliberately not do, to keep it inside the appetite."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-00000b",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Risks and rabbit holes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-00000c"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The parts that could take much longer than they look."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-00000d",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open questions and the ask"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "blockId": "b-00000e"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What the reader must decide, and the options."
